であり、クラスメイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりしているが人懐っこく明るい性格で、誰とでもすぐ打ち解けられる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"芯が強くしっかり者であるが、それを補って有り余るほどのドジ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分がとろくさいということには知っているが、本当の意味では気づいていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのおかげでマスコットのような存在になっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"反面頭の回転が早く、恐ろしく察しがいい。他人のちょっとした変化でも直ぐに気付く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に主人公に対しての変化にはものすごく敏感であり、隠し事などがあると簡単にわかってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、それについて何も言おうとはしない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「その、少しくらいは私に相談とかさ、してくれてもいいんじゃないのかなぁ？」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"641","sourceWorkId":"16205","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の幼なじみであり、クラスメイト。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりしているが人懐っこく明るい性格で、誰とでもすぐ打ち解けられる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"芯が強くしっかり者であるが、それを補って余りあるほどのドジ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分がとろくさいということは知っているが、本当の意味では気付いていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"反面頭の回転が早く、恐ろしく察しがいい。他人のちょっとした変化にもすぐに気付く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「その、少しくらいは私に相談とかさ、してくれてもいいんじゃないのかなぁ？」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"15023"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"641","sourceWorkId":"16205","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"158 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"641","sourceWorkId":"16205","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"82 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"641","sourceWorkId":"16205","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"54 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"641","sourceWorkId":"16205","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5f/5f327d38314a97db71605c024e4253a9273d24da2973a5baabdfdac60fc4fac5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4f/4f0bc808cbf98555b52cfcd7989790b08c9699ca8abe6381e75ba6fc5b01d856.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"眞田朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s610","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s610","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s610","name":"眞田 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:246029:15023:5928:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c15920","characterName":"鳴ヶ崎 カンナ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"15024","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"246029"},{"characterId":"15024","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"25543"}],"egsCharacterIds":["643"],"vndbCharacterId":"c15920"},"originalCharacterName":"鳴ヶ崎 カンナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"417"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"egs","value":"O"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"90"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kanna is a returnee student who spent most of her life and school years abroad. Her grandfather is American and used to be a quarterback. She had recently transferred back to Japan to Takaya's school at an unusual time of the year. She currently lives in her family's shrine, \"Narugasaki Shrine\", and works there as a miko."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Actually, Kanna is pretty shy because she is not used to the life in Japan. Kanna likes giving others cute nicknames."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c15920"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【クォーター風の転校生】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"原画：立羽"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"年齢：学園3年生、クラス：3-A"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績：中の上"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味：手芸（裁縫）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"部活：帰宅部"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外国暮らしが長かったため、自己主張の強い一面がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"思ったことをズバズバ言うが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悪気があるわけではないよく人にあだ名をつける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あぁ、こんな素敵なお友達がすぐに出来るなんて、私は幸せ者ですわね」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"643","sourceWorkId":"16205","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"時期外れの転校をしてくる帰国子女。祖父がアメリカ人でクォーター。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外国暮らしが長かったため、自己主張の強い一面がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在は実家の 『鳴ヶ崎神社』 に住んでいて、巫女として仕事もしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"思ったことをズバズバ言うが、悪気があるわけではない。 また、よく人にあだ名を付ける。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実際は人見知りが激しく、私生活ではオドオドしがち。海外に住んでいる頃から、向こうの生活にはあまり馴染めずにいた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「あぁ、こんな素敵なお友達がすぐに出来るなんて、私は幸せ者ですわね」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"15024"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"643","sourceWorkId":"16205","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"160 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"643","sourceWorkId":"16205","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"83 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"643","sourceWorkId":"16205","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"55 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"643","sourceWorkId":"16205","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/2099209de644c7f1549f22407a42789450004bcc4ffef2a9d8687a549042ee67.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/23a830a0428164669bc0a036f404184b3c440046e77c8414165e11ee5177fa65.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"青葉りんご","creatorId":"vndb:s295","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s295","canonicalEntityId":"vn