{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Takaya's and Akeno's father, Miyabi's step father."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c15924"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【主人公の父親】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"孝也と朱乃の父親。みやびにとっては義父。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本編１話で静音と再婚をする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"静音とは同じ会社の上司と部下。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに司が部下。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"静音にとってはよき部下であり、パートナー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元妻を早くに亡くし、孝也と朱乃を男手一つで育ててきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"孝也たちの理解もあり、仕事を優先して家を空けがち。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"静音とは仕事を通じて、支えてきた事から恋愛に発展した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"大らかに受け入れる性格であり、若干気弱な面もある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が、大人としてはしっかりしているので、いざという時頼りになる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"静音もそういう面に惚れている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"645","sourceWorkId":"16205","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d8/d84abeb6d585065bcc984fab8b7b019850f83516c5fc5793ca2bc0de31d232c1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/01/01dd145df262bb6b97256c45a443a9dedd05933c11009c14d381bf8c87c8189b.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"越田 直樹","creatorId":"vndb:s6882","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6882","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6882","name":"越田 直樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:43024","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c15925","characterName":"天原 静音","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["644"],"vndbCharacterId":"c15925"},"originalCharacterName":"天原 静音","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Takaya's and Akeno's step mother, Miyabi's real mother."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c15925"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【主人公の義理の母親】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"みやびの母親。孝也と朱乃にとっては義母。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"司の会社の上司で、恋人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キャリアウーマンで、あまり家庭を顧みなかった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それが原因で、元夫とは離婚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"みやびが優秀な子だったため、ますます仕事に没頭していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"みやびもそれを認めているので、家族仲は良好。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が、再婚話に関してはちょっと納得がいっていなかった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さすがに同い年の男子がいるってどうよ？　とかなんとか。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あまり人を頼らないタイプで、司はある意味例外。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"司が積極的に支えてくれるため、そこに頼っていくようになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"結果として、他人に甘える事の心地よさを知る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"みやびの性格の一部は、この母親譲り。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"644","sourceWorkId":"16205","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9c597007f4c283f8b6c71717e5312ae68ae9a55c3df611905098236bd792a792.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e1/e1f5eb9e0576f1a272ce1ba0ae9af8705058bd42e489d8fe362e0fb937f31ad5.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"香澄 りょう","creatorId":"vndb:s29","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s29","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s29","name":"高城 みつ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:43017","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c15919","characterName":"上杉 孝也","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c15919"},"originalCharacterName":"上杉 孝也","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist of this work. After the remarriage of his father, he and Miyabi had become siblings-in-law. Takaya also has a real sister - Akeno; and a childhood friend - Nazuki."}],"source":"vn